4. **Every long-lived root spawn goes through the helper**:
   - `tests/support/piped.rs` (`Piped::spawn` ties the `Command` it is handed);
   - `tests/support/cli.rs` (`spawn` builds through `tied::viola()`);
   - `tests/support/start.rs`, `tests/support/verify.rs` (their `Command::new(VIOLA)` sites);
   - each direct site of the derived set `command grep -rlE "Command::new\((support::|home::)?VIOLA\)" tests`
     (44 hits in 24 files, research §Sweeps), each `Command::new(VIOLA)` becoming `tied::viola()` with no other change
     to the call.
   The outer-PTY spawns (`OuterPty`, over `viola_pty::spawn`) stay as they are: they end by hangup (measured,
   research §Measurements), and step 6 witnesses that.

- **Measurements this plan rests on** (research §Measurements): the outer-PTY orphan gone after the holder's SIGKILL;
  the piped orphan alive at 0 % CPU over 5.0 s. The «99 %» of the carry is not reproduced at HEAD, and the chunk ends
  a wrapper whatever it loops on.

- **Files:** new `tests/support/tied.rs`, `tests/cross_killed_test.rs`, `crates/viola-e2e/tests/harness_tied.rs`;
  modified `tests/support/{home,mod,piped,cli,start,verify}.rs`, `tests/cli_verify.rs`,
  `crates/viola-e2e/src/harness/{boot,session}.rs`, `crates/viola-e2e/src/bin/viola-harness.rs`, `.config/nextest.toml`;
  the 21 root test files the derived `tests/*.rs` item absorbed (`gate.py scope`); companions
  `crates/viola-e2e/src/harness/run/perf.rs`, `crates/viola-e2e/tests/harness_lifecycle.rs`, `crates/viola-e2e/tests/cli.rs`.

P3 smoke, by hand (the CLI `boot` arm of crates/viola-e2e/src/bin/viola-harness.rs touched; its supervisor must stay untied and outlive `boot`).
Each step's stdout written to a scratchpad file and read whole; `boot` run under `timeout -k 10 900`.

bash scripts/agent-run.sh boot --session smoke-tied → exit 0
{"v":1,"cmd":"boot","ok":true,"session":"smoke-tied","home":"./target/e2e-home/viola-session-vCkqMN/home","instances":[{"name":"overseer","wrapper_pid":3574040,"child_pid":3574056},{"name":"builder","wrapper_pid":3574042,"child_pid":3574057}]}

bash scripts/agent-run.sh status --session smoke-tied (after boot exited) → exit 0
{"v":1,"cmd":"status","ok":true,"state":"ready", … "instances":[{"name":"overseer","wrapper_pid":3574040,"alive":true},{"name":"builder","wrapper_pid":3574042,"alive":true}]}

bash scripts/agent-run.sh cleanup --session smoke-tied → exit 0
{"v":1,"cmd":"cleanup","ok":true,"cleaned":["smoke-tied"],"processes_gone":true,"endpoint_gone":true,"home_removed":true,"killed":[]}

Reading: the untied CLI supervisor outlived `boot` (status ready after boot's exit) and was ended by cleanup's stop.request (killed []).
